## SAMIZDATA report styling

- This project includes the pinned SAMIZDATA Quarto Brand Extension under `_extensions/`.
- PDF reports use the same Space Grotesk and Work Sans families from vendored files in `fonts/`.
- `samizdata-pdf.tex` and `samizdata-before-body.tex` contain only PDF delivery and composition overrides.
{% elif outlet == 'zdg' -%}
## Ziarul de Gardă report styling

- This project includes the pinned Ziarul de Gardă Quarto Brand Extension under `_extensions/`.
- PDF reports use Source Serif Pro and Source Sans Pro when they are installed; otherwise LuaLaTeX uses its default fonts.
- `zdg-pdf.tex` contains only PDF delivery overrides.
{% endif -%}
{% if charts == 'mozaic' %}
## Charts

`charts/` holds the [mozaic](https://github.com/samizdata-co/mozaic) charts: one folder per chart in `charts/src/charts/`, built as static embeds and print files. It installs mozaic from npm (`@samizdata/mozaic`).

```bash
cd charts
pnpm install
pnpm dev       # preview every chart at http://localhost:5173
pnpm check     # type-check
pnpm build     # static embeds in charts/build/
pnpm export    # SVG, PDF and PNG in charts/exports/ (needs a Chromium)
```

Write the data each chart needs to `charts/data/` (committed; `data/processed/` is not). The house style is `charts/src/lib/theme.ts`{% if outlet != 'none' %}, which uses the copy of the outlet's brand in `charts/src/lib/brands/` (do not edit it; `copier update` brings new brand releases){% endif %}. See `charts/AGENTS.md` for the conventions.
{% endif %}
## Tracking time

This project uses [klog](https://klog.jotaen.net/) to track time spent on it.

You can start tracking time by running:

```bash
klog start hours.klg
```

To stop tracking time, run:

```bash
klog stop hours.klg
```

Or to take a break:

```bash
klog pause --summary 'Lunch break' hours.klg
```
